# Editing-tool scratch: Claude Code tracks its writes here and recreates the
# directory whenever the repo is edited with it. Never part of the plugin.
.claude/

# Note: dist/ is intentionally committed. Cursor installs marketplace plugins
# straight from the Git repository with no build or install step, so the hook
# bundle has to be in the tree. `pnpm run lint` rebuilds it and CI verifies the
# committed bundle is current.
